{"slides": [{"number": 1, "title": "音声からスライド動画を作る流れ", "timestamp_start": 0, "timestamp_end": 16, "segment_ids": [], "speakers_words": "今日は、音声からスライド動画を作る流れを確認します。大事なポイントは三つあります。", "keywords": ["音声", "スライド動画", "流れ"], "visual_role": "導入タイトル", "main_visual": "大きなタイトルと流れの図", "energy_level": "medium"}, {"number": 2, "title": "日本語の読みやすさと復元確認", "timestamp_start": 16, "timestamp_end": 32, "segment_ids": [], "speakers_words": "日本語が読みやすく、余白が詰まりすぎていないこと。保存して、あとから復元できることも確認します。", "keywords": ["日本語", "読みやすさ", "復元"], "visual_role": "確認ポイント", "main_visual": "3つのチェックカード", "energy_level": "medium"}], "strategy": {"content_analysis": {"core_message": "音声から高品質なスライド動画を自動生成するVoiSlideの品質評価プロセス", "emotional_tone": "プロフェッショナル、信頼感、テクニカル、クリア", "key_concepts": ["音声認識", "スライド生成", "日本語処理", "品質評価", "自動化ワークフロー"], "target_audience": "技術評価者、プロダクトマネージャー、日本語コンテンツ制作者"}, "design_style": {"concept_name": "Sonic Clarity - 音の明瞭さ", "concept_description": "音声波形と日本語の流麗さを融合させた、クリーンでテクニカルなデザイン。十分な余白を確保しつつ画面を効果的に使い、日本語タイトルの可読性を最優先に設計。語中で文字が分断されない丁寧なレイアウトを実現する。", "color_palette": {"primary": "#2563EB", "secondary": "#0EA5E9", "accent": "#F59E0B", "background_start": "#0F172A", "background_end": "#1E293B"}, "typography_direction": "タイトルは太めのゴシック体（Noto Sans JP Bold）で力強く明瞭に、本文は中細のゴシック体で読みやすさを重視。日本語の自然な文節を尊重し、語中で改行せず単語単位でまとまりを保つ。", "visual_theme": "音声波形をモチーフにした抽象的なライン、グリッドベースの整然としたレイアウト、グロウエフェクトによる先進的な印象、余白を活かしたミニマルかつ情報密度の高い構成"}, "_design_mode": "flash_standard"}, "html_contents": ["<!DOCTYPE html>\n\n<html lang=\"ja\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\"/>\n<title>音声からスライド動画を作る流れ</title>\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+JP:wght@400;700;900&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\"/>\n<style>\n  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    width: 1920px; height: 1080px;\n    font-family: 'Noto Sans JP', sans-serif;\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0F172A 0%, #1E293B 100%);\n    position: relative;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    padding: 40px 50px !important;\n  }\n\n  /* 背景装飾：グラデーション円 */\n  .glow-1 {\n    position: absolute;\n    width: 1000px; height: 1000px;\n    left: -250px; top: -350px;\n    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(37,99,235,0.4) 0%, rgba(37,99,235,0) 70%);\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    filter: blur(20px);\n  }\n  .glow-2 {\n    position: absolute;\n    width: 900px; height: 900px;\n    right: -250px; bottom: -300px;\n    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(14,165,233,0.35) 0%, rgba(14,165,233,0) 70%);\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    filter: blur(20px);\n  }\n  .glow-3 {\n    position: absolute;\n    width: 500px; height: 500px;\n    left: 50%; top: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\n    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(245,158,11,0.18) 0%, rgba(245,158,11,0) 70%);\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    filter: blur(30px);\n  }\n\n  /* 音声波形ライン */\n  .waveform {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 8px;\n    align-items: center;\n    height: 90px;\n  }\n  .waveform.top { top: 160px; }\n  .waveform.bottom { bottom: 160px; }\n  .bar {\n    width: 4px;\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #2563EB, #0EA5E9);\n    border-radius: 2px;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(14,165,233,0.6);\n  }\n\n  /* グリッドパターン */\n  .grid-bg {\n    position: absolute;\n    inset: 0;\n    background-image: \n      linear-gradient(rgba(148,163,184,0.04) 1px, transparent 1px),\n      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(148,163,184,0.04) 1px, transparent 1px);\n    background-size: 80px 80px;\n  }\n\n  /* 粒子 */\n  .particle {\n    position: absolute;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #F59E0B;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 20px #F59E0B;\n  }\n  .p1 { width: 6px; height: 6px; top: 25%; left: 18%; }\n  .p2 { width: 4px; height: 4px; top: 70%; left: 12%; opacity: 0.7; }\n  .p3 { width: 8px; height: 8px; top: 35%; right: 15%; opacity: 0.8; }\n  .p4 { width: 5px; height: 5px; bottom: 30%; right: 20%; }\n  .p5 { width: 4px; height: 4px; top: 15%; left: 55%; background: #0EA5E9; box-shadow: 0 0 15px #0EA5E9; }\n  .p6 { width: 6px; height: 6px; bottom: 20%; left: 48%; background: #0EA5E9; box-shadow: 0 0 18px #0EA5E9; }\n  .p7 { width: 5px; height: 5px; top: 45%; left: 8%; background: #0EA5E9; box-shadow: 0 0 15px #0EA5E9; opacity: 0.8;}\n  .p8 { width: 4px; height: 4px; top: 55%; right: 10%; opacity: 0.7;}\n\n  /* 中央コンテンツ */\n  .container {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 100%; height: 100%;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    z-index: 10;\n  }\n\n  .eyebrow {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 24px;\n    margin-bottom: 56px;\n  }\n  .eyebrow .line {\n    width: 100px; height: 2px;\n    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, #0EA5E9);\n  }\n  .eyebrow .line.right {\n    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #0EA5E9, transparent);\n  }\n  .eyebrow span {\n    font-size: 22px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: 0.45em;\n    color: #0EA5E9;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n  }\n\n  h1 {\n    font-size: 104px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    line-height: 1.22;\n    letter-spacing: 0.02em;\n    text-align: center;\n    white-space: normal;\n    overflow: visible;\n    overflow-wrap: normal;\n    word-break: normal;\n    line-break: strict;\n    text-wrap: balance;\n    max-width: 95%;\n    padding: 0 20px;\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFFFFF 0%, #E0F2FE 50%, #FBBF24 100%);\n    -webkit-background-clip: text;\n    background-clip: text;\n    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\n    filter: drop-shadow(0 0 40px rgba(37,99,235,0.35));\n  }\n\n  .divider {\n    margin-top: 64px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 24px;\n  }\n  .divider .dot {\n    width: 12px; height: 12px;\n    background: #F59E0B;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 24px #F59E0B;\n  }\n  .divider .bar-h {\n    width: 160px; height: 2px;\n    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, #F59E0B, transparent);\n  }\n\n  .tagline {\n    margin-top: 36px;\n    font-size: 24px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    letter-spacing: 0.3em;\n    color: rgba(226,232,240,0.7);\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n  }\n  .tagline b {\n    color: #F59E0B;\n    font-weight: 700;\n  }\n\n  /* スライド番号 */\n  .slide-number {\n    position: absolute;\n    bottom: 50px; right: 60px;\n    font-size: 18px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: rgba(148,163,184,0.6);\n    letter-spacing: 0.2em;\n    z-index: 20;\n  }\n  .brand {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 50px; left: 60px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 12px;\n    z-index: 20;\n  }\n  .brand-dot {\n    width: 12px; height: 12px;\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2563EB, #0EA5E9);\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(14,165,233,0.8);\n  }\n  .brand span {\n    font-size: 26px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: #94A3B8;\n    letter-spacing: 0.3em;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"grid-bg\"></div>\n<div class=\"glow-1\"></div>\n<div class=\"glow-2\"></div>\n<div class=\"glow-3\"></div>\n<div class=\"particle p1\"></div>\n<div class=\"particle p2\"></div>\n<div class=\"particle p3\"></div>\n<div class=\"particle p4\"></div>\n<div class=\"particle p5\"></div>\n<div class=\"particle p6\"></div>\n<div class=\"particle p7\"></div>\n<div class=\"particle p8\"></div>\n<!-- 上部波形 -->\n<div class=\"waveform top\" id=\"wtop\"></div>\n<!-- 下部波形 -->\n<div class=\"waveform bottom\" id=\"wbot\"></div>\n<div class=\"brand\">\n<div class=\"brand-dot\"></div>\n<span>SONIC CLARITY</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"eyebrow\">\n<div class=\"line\"></div>\n<span>Workflow Overview</span>\n<div class=\"line right\"></div>\n</div>\n<h1>音声からスライド動画を作る流れ</h1>\n<div class=\"divider\">\n<div class=\"bar-h\"></div>\n<div class=\"dot\"></div>\n<div class=\"bar-h\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tagline\">VOICE  <b>→</b>  SLIDE  <b>→</b>  VIDEO</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"slide-number\">01 / 02</div>\n<script>\n    const heights = [20,35,55,70,45,60,80,50,30,65,45,75,40,55,70,35,50,65,45,30,55,70,40,60,75,45,55,35,50,65,40,70,55,30,45];\n    const top = document.getElementById('wtop');\n    const bot = document.getElementById('wbot');\n    heights.forEach(h => {\n      const b1 = document.createElement('div');\n      b1.className = 'bar'; b1.style.height = h + 'px';\n      top.appendChild(b1);\n      const b2 = document.createElement('div');\n      b2.className = 'bar'; b2.style.height = h + 'px';\n      bot.appendChild(b2);\n    });\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "<!DOCTYPE html>\n\n<html lang=\"ja\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\"/>\n<title>日本語の読みやすさと復元確認</title>\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+JP:wght@400;700;900&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\"/>\n<style>\n  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n  \n  body {\n    width: 1920px;\n    height: 1080px;\n    font-family: 'Noto Sans JP', sans-serif;\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0F172A 0%, #1E293B 100%);\n    padding: 40px 50px !important;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    overflow: visible !important;\n    position: relative;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n  }\n\n  .wave-decoration {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 50%;\n    left: 0;\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 2px;\n    transform: translateY(-50%);\n    background: linear-gradient(90deg, \n      transparent 0%, \n      rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.15) 20%, \n      rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.35) 50%, \n      rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.15) 80%, \n      transparent 100%);\n    z-index: 1;\n  }\n\n  .glow-orb {\n    position: absolute;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    filter: blur(120px);\n    z-index: 0;\n  }\n\n  .orb-1 {\n    width: 700px;\n    height: 700px;\n    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.3) 0%, transparent 70%);\n    top: -200px;\n    left: -200px;\n  }\n\n  .orb-2 {\n    width: 600px;\n    height: 600px;\n    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.25) 0%, transparent 70%);\n    bottom: -150px;\n    right: -150px;\n  }\n\n  .orb-3 {\n    width: 350px;\n    height: 350px;\n    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.15) 0%, transparent 70%);\n    top: 35%;\n    right: 18%;\n  }\n\n  .container {\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 10;\n    text-align: center;\n    max-width: 1700px;\n    padding: 0 20px;\n  }\n\n  .eyebrow {\n    font-size: 24px;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    letter-spacing: 0.8em;\n    color: #F59E0B;\n    margin-bottom: 70px;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    opacity: 0.95;\n  }\n\n  .eyebrow-dot {\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: 10px;\n    height: 10px;\n    background: #F59E0B;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    margin: 0 22px;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 24px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.9);\n  }\n\n  h1 {\n    font-size: 150px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    line-height: 1.22;\n    letter-spacing: 0.02em;\n    white-space: normal;\n    overflow: visible;\n    max-width: 95%;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 0 20px;\n    text-align: center;\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFFFFF 0%, #06B6D4 50%, #FFFFFF 100%);\n    -webkit-background-clip: text;\n    background-clip: text;\n    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\n    text-shadow: 0 0 80px rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.3);\n    overflow-wrap: normal;\n    word-break: normal;\n    line-break: strict;\n    text-wrap: balance;\n  }\n\n  .waveform {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 10px;\n    margin-top: 90px;\n    height: 80px;\n  }\n\n  .wave-bar {\n    width: 5px;\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #2563EB 0%, #0EA5E9 100%);\n    border-radius: 3px;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.7);\n  }\n\n  .wave-bar:nth-child(1) { height: 20%; }\n  .wave-bar:nth-child(2) { height: 45%; }\n  .wave-bar:nth-child(3) { height: 70%; }\n  .wave-bar:nth-child(4) { height: 90%; }\n  .wave-bar:nth-child(5) { height: 100%; background: linear-gradient(180deg, #F59E0B 0%, #0EA5E9 100%); box-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.7); }\n  .wave-bar:nth-child(6) { height: 85%; }\n  .wave-bar:nth-child(7) { height: 60%; }\n  .wave-bar:nth-child(8) { height: 35%; }\n  .wave-bar:nth-child(9) { height: 15%; }\n\n  .slide-number {\n    position: absolute;\n    bottom: 40px;\n    right: 60px;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.45);\n    letter-spacing: 0.25em;\n    z-index: 20;\n  }\n\n  .corner-mark {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 50px;\n    left: 60px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 12px;\n    z-index: 20;\n  }\n\n  .corner-dot {\n    width: 10px;\n    height: 10px;\n    background: #0EA5E9;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.9);\n  }\n\n  .corner-line {\n    width: 80px;\n    height: 1px;\n    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #0EA5E9 0%, transparent 100%);\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"glow-orb orb-1\"></div>\n<div class=\"glow-orb orb-2\"></div>\n<div class=\"glow-orb orb-3\"></div>\n<div class=\"wave-decoration\"></div>\n<div class=\"corner-mark\">\n<div class=\"corner-dot\"></div>\n<div class=\"corner-line\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"eyebrow\">CLOSING<span class=\"eyebrow-dot\"></span>SONIC CLARITY</div>\n<h1>日本語の読みやすさと<br/>復元確認</h1>\n<div class=\"waveform\">\n<div class=\"wave-bar\"></div>\n<div class=\"wave-bar\"></div>\n<div class=\"wave-bar\"></div>\n<div class=\"wave-bar\"></div>\n<div class=\"wave-bar\"></div>\n<div class=\"wave-bar\"></div>\n<div class=\"wave-bar\"></div>\n<div class=\"wave-bar\"></div>\n<div class=\"wave-bar\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"slide-number\">02 / 02</div>\n</body>\n</html>"], "design_quality_metrics": [{"min_font_size_px": 24.0, "title_font_size_px": 104.0, "body_font_size_px_min": 104.0, "small_text_count": 0, "fallback_used": false, "quality_gate": "pass", "warnings": [], "slide_number": 1}, {"min_font